    "statementMarkdown": "For a positive integer $n$ consider any partition of the set $\\{1,2,\\ldots,2n\\}$ into $n$ two-element subsets $P_1,P_2,\\ldots,P_n$. In each subset $P_i$, let $p_i$ be the product of the two numbers in $P_i$. Prove that\n\n$$\n\\frac1{p_1}+\\frac1{p_2}+\\cdots+\\frac1{p_n}<1.\n$$\n",
