    "statementMarkdown": "A sequence of integers $a_1,a_2,a_3,\\ldots$ is called exact if\n\n$$\na_n^2-a_m^2=a_{n-m}a_{n+m}\n$$\n\nfor any $n>m$. Prove that there exists an exact sequence with $a_1=1$, $a_2=0$, and determine $a_{2007}$.\n",
