    "targetFormat": "statement-markdown",
    "statementMarkdown": "A function $f$ is defined on the set of all real numbers except $0$ and takes all real values except $1$. It is also known that\n\n$$\nf(xy)=f(x)f(-y)-f(x)+f(y)\n$$\n\nfor any $x,y\\ne0$, and that\n\n$$\nf(f(x))=\\frac{1}{f(1/x)}\n$$\n\nfor any $x\\notin\\{0,1\\}$. Determine all such functions $f$.\n",
